{"page":183,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:46","surah":8,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ وَلَا تَنَـٰزَعُوا۟ فَتَفْشَلُوا۟ وَتَذْهَبَ رِيحُكُمْ ۖ وَٱصْبِرُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ مَعَ ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Obey God and His Messenger, and do not quarrel with one another, or you may lose heart and your spirit may desert you. Be steadfast: God is with the steadfast.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"And obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَنَـٰزَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"dispute","transliteration":"tanāzaʿū","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَتَفْشَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"lest you lose courage","transliteration":"fatafshalū","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَتَذْهَبَ","en_gloss":"and (would) depart","transliteration":"watadhhaba","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رِيحُكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your strength","transliteration":"rīḥukum","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱصْبِرُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"and be patient","transliteration":"wa-iṣ'birū","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"(is) with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the patient ones","transliteration":"l-ṣābirīna","verse_key":"8:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٦","en_gloss":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:46"}]},{"verse_key":"8:47","surah":8,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَكُونُوا۟ كَٱلَّذِينَ خَرَجُوا۟ مِن دِيَـٰرِهِم بَطَرًا وَرِئَآءَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَيَصُدُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا يَعْمَلُونَ مُحِيطٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not be like those who came out of their homes full of conceit, showing off to people, and barring others from the way of God- God has full knowledge of all that they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"takūnū","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"like those who","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَرَجُوا۟","en_gloss":"came forth","transliteration":"kharajū","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دِيَـٰرِهِم","en_gloss":"their homes","transliteration":"diyārihim","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَطَرًۭا","en_gloss":"boastfully","transliteration":"baṭaran","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرِئَآءَ","en_gloss":"and showing off","transliteration":"wariāa","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(to) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَصُدُّونَ","en_gloss":"and hinder (them)","transliteration":"wayaṣuddūna","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مُحِيطٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Encompassing","transliteration":"muḥīṭun","verse_key":"8:47"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٤٧","en_gloss":"(47)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:47"}]},{"verse_key":"8:48","surah":8,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ زَيَّنَ لَهُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ وَقَالَ لَا غَالِبَ لَكُمُ ٱلْيَوْمَ مِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَإِنِّى جَارٌ لَّكُمْ ۖ فَلَمَّا تَرَآءَتِ ٱلْفِئَتَانِ نَكَصَ عَلَىٰ عَقِبَيْهِ وَقَالَ إِنِّى بَرِىٓءٌ مِّنكُمْ إِنِّىٓ أَرَىٰ مَا لَا تَرَوْنَ إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ ٱللَّهَ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ شَدِيدُ ٱلْعِقَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Satan made their foul deeds seem fair to them, and said, ‘No one will conquer you today, for I will be right beside you,’ but when the armies came within sight of one another he turned on his heels, saying, ‘This is where I leave you: I see what you do not, and I fear God- God is severe in His punishment.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"زَيَّنَ","en_gloss":"made fair-seeming","transliteration":"zayyana","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"and he said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"No (one)","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"غَالِبَ","en_gloss":"(can) overcome","transliteration":"ghāliba","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_gloss":"[to] you","transliteration":"lakumu","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَإِنِّى","en_gloss":"and indeed, I am","transliteration":"wa-innī","verse_key":"8:48"},{"pos":14,"ar":"جَارٌۭ","en_gloss":"a neighbor","transliteratio